    "body": "\n\n**Commercial Reference:** Dior Homme Intense \u00d7 Roja Enigma  \n**Wearing Impression:** A sculptural iris wrapped in buttery suede and warm cashmere. Opens with a flash of bergamot and cardamom spice before revealing a deep orris-violet heart over a bed of sandalwood and clean amber. The kind of fragrance that makes people lean closer.  \n**Concentration:** 25% in ethanol  \n**Luxury Rating:** \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 \u2014 Six luxury differentiators anchored by a generous Alpha Irone dose; Javanol and Ambrox Super provide the skin-scent intimacy of a true Extrait.\n\n| # | Ingredient | Dilution | Amount (\u00b5L) | Amount (mL) |\n|---|-----------|----------|------------|------------|\n| 1 | Bergamot FCF Sicilian | neat | 120 | 0.12 |\n| 2 | Cardamom FTEC | 10% | 80 | 0.08 |\n| 3 | Aldehyde C11 | 1% | 50 | 0.05 |\n| 4 | Alpha Irone | 10% | 450 | 0.45 |\n| 5 | Orivone | neat | 80 | 0.08 |\n| 6 | Methyl Ionone | neat | 120 | 0.12 |\n| 7 | Hedione | neat | 200 | 0.20 |\n| 8 | Suederal | 10% | 100 | 0.10 |\n| 9 | Javanol | neat | 150 | 0.15 |\n| 10 | Cashmeran | 20% | 200 | 0.20 |\n| 11 | Ambrox Super | 30% | 200 | 0.20 |\n| 12 | Habanolide | neat | 100 | 0.10 |\n| 13 | Iso E Super | neat | 300 | 0.30 |\n| 14 | Benzyl Salicylate | neat | 100 | 0.10 |\n| 15 | Vanillin | 10% | 100 | 0.10 |\n| 16 | Coumarin | 20% | 150 | 0.15 |\n| 17 | **Ethanol 96%** | \u2014 | \u2014 | **7.50** |\n| | **TOTAL** | | | **10.00** |\n\n**Concentrate total:** 2.50 mL (25.0%)\n\n---\n\n"
