    "full_text": "\u2550\u2550\u2550 MIXING PROTOCOL: Iris Imp\u00e9riale \u2014 Powdery Iris / Suede \u2550\u2550\u2550\nMaterials: 16 | Total: 100.0%\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 WARNINGS \u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u26a0 CRYSTALLINE SOLIDS: Vanillin, Coumarin \u2014 dissolve in warm solvent before adding.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 0.5: DISSOLUTION \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  1. Dissolve Vanillin in warm ethanol or DPG (40-50\u00b0C) until fully clear before adding to formula.\n  2. Dissolve Coumarin in warm ethanol or DPG (40-50\u00b0C) until fully clear before adding to formula.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 1: BASE LAYER (foundation) \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Step 3. Add Ambrox Super (8.0%)\n           Base note \u2014 add early for structural foundation.\n  Step 4. Add Iso E Super (12.0%)\n           Base note \u2014 add early for structural foundation.\n  Step 5. Add Orivone (3.2%)\n           Base note \u2014 add early for structural foundation.\n  Step 6. Add Benzyl Salicylate (4.0%)\n           Base note \u2014 add early for structural foundation.\n  Step 7. Add Suederal (4.0%)\n           Base note \u2014 add early for structural foundation.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 2: HEART LAYER (character) \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Step 8. Add Alpha Irone (18.0%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  Step 9. Add Methyl Ionone (4.8%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  Step 10. Add Hedione (8.0%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  Step 11. Add Javanol (6.0%)\n           Heart note \u2014 forms the core character.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 3: MUSKS (smoothing) \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Step 12. Add Habanolide (4.0%)\n           Musk \u2014 add after structure is set; wraps and smooths.\n  Step 13. Add Cashmeran (8.0%)\n           Musk \u2014 add after structure is set; wraps and smooths.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 PHASE 4: TOP NOTES (sparkle) \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Step 14. Add Aldehyde C11 (2.0%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 15. Add Bergamot FCF Sicilian (4.8%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  Step 16. Add Cardamom FTEC (3.2%)\n           Top note \u2014 most volatile, add last to preserve freshness.\n  \u2192 Stir gently for 2-3 minutes. Let rest 5 minutes.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 MACERATION \u2500\u2500\u2500\n  Seal tightly and store in a cool, dark place.\n  Estimated maturation: 19 days minimum.\n  Check at day 7 for initial impressions.\n  Best results typically at day 19 \u2013 33."
